{"ad_products": {"AUCTION": {"display_name": "Auction (Objective Based Buying)", "description": "The default self-serve ad product. Used when ad_product is UNSET or UNKNOWN.", "campaign": {"create": {"allowed_values": {"objective": ["REACH", "IMPRESSIONS", "CLICKS", "VIDEO_VIEWS", "APP_INSTALLS", "WEBSITE_VISITS", "PODCAST_STREAMS", "LEAD_GEN", "UNSET_OPTIMIZATION_PREF"], "delivery_goal_group": ["UNSET", "AWARENESS", "WEBSITE_TRAFFIC", "APP_PROMOTION", "ENGAGEMENT_ON_SPOTIFY", "LEAD_GEN", "VIDEO_VIEWS"]}, "constraints": ["When objective is a real value and delivery_goal_group is not supplied, the server derives delivery_goal_group from it: REACH/IMPRESSIONS/VIDEO_VIEWS -> AWARENESS, CLICKS/WEBSITE_VISITS -> WEBSITE_TRAFFIC, PODCAST_STREAMS -> ENGAGEMENT_ON_SPOTIFY, APP_INSTALLS -> APP_PROMOTION, LEAD_GEN -> LEAD_GEN. For CLICKS this is a context-free default: the per-ad-set resolution that returns ENGAGEMENT_ON_SPOTIFY when the ad set targets artists applies only while delivery_goal_group is unset", "When delivery_goal_group is supplied and does not match the mapping above for the objective sent, objective is force-set to UNSET_OPTIMIZATION_PREF"]}, "update": {"allowed_values": {"status": ["ACTIVE", "PAUSED"]}, "restrictions": ["Cannot edit an archived campaign"]}, "both": {"constraints": ["end_time must be within 365 days of start_time", "start_time must be at least 15 minutes in the future"]}}, "ad_set": {"create": {"allowed_values": {"asset_format": ["AUDIO", "VIDEO", "IMAGE", "CATALOG"]}, "required_fields": ["start_time: required; must be at least 15 minutes in the future", "category: required when targets.geo_targets is present", "mobile_app_id: required when campaign objective is APP_INSTALLS", "bid_micro_amount: required when bid_strategy is MAX_BID or COST_PER_RESULT"], "cross_field_rules": ["When campaign objective is APP_INSTALLS: targets.platforms must contain exactly one of IOS or ANDROID (not both, not DESKTOP)", "When campaign objective is VIDEO_VIEWS: asset_format must be VIDEO; targets.platforms cannot include WEB, CAR, or CONNECTED", "When asset_format is VIDEO and targets.placements is both MUSIC and PODCAST (automatic placement): video_delivery_formats must be [IN_STREAM, OPT_IN]"]}, "update": {"restrictions": ["budget.type: cannot change between DAILY and LIFETIME after creation", "pacing: cannot slow down (e.g., PACING_ASAP to PACING_EVEN is blocked)", "When bid_strategy is COST_PER_RESULT: pacing cannot change from PACING_EVEN", "Budget decrease (LIFETIME, started flight): cannot go below 1.0x lifetime spend; buffer of 1.1x for PACING_EVEN, 1.2x for PACING_ASAP; 1-hour cooldown between decreases", "start_time: cannot change after delivery has started (lifetime spend > 0)", "targets.language: cannot change after creation", "video_delivery_formats: cannot change after creation (if already set)", "Cannot edit an archived or completed ad set"]}, "both": {"allowed_values": {"bid_strategy": ["MAX_BID", "COST_PER_RESULT", "AUTOBID", "UNSET"], "budget.type": ["DAILY", "LIFETIME"], "targets.placements": ["MUSIC", "PODCAST"], "pacing": ["PACING_EVEN", "PACING_ASAP"], "targets.platforms": ["ANDROID", "DESKTOP", "IOS"]}, "frequency_caps": {"max_impressions": {"DAY": 5, "WEEK": 35, "MONTH": 50}}, "required_fields": ["targets.platforms: at least one platform must be specified"], "forbidden_fields": ["frequency_caps with group: group frequency caps are not supported"], "cross_field_rules": ["When bid_strategy is COST_PER_RESULT: budget.type must be LIFETIME, pacing must be PACING_EVEN, and bid_micro_amount must be > 0, <= budget.micro_amount, and >= the audience scale bid floor (runtime check)", "When campaign objective is CLICKS, WEBSITE_VISITS, PODCAST_STREAMS, or LEAD_GEN: targets.platforms cannot include CAR or CONNECTED", "When asset_format is VIDEO, IMAGE, or CATALOG: targets.platforms cannot include WEB, CAR, or CONNECTED (audio-only platforms)", "When asset_format is IMAGE or CATALOG: targets.placements cannot contain PODCAST", "When targets.placements is MUSIC only (no PODCAST): podcast_episode_topic_ids and sensitive_topic_exclusions must not be set", "When targets.placements contains PODCAST: the targeted country must be a GA or BETA podcast market (runtime check)", "When delivery_goal_group is set on the campaign, the ad set's delivery_goal must match: AWARENESS allows IMPRESSIONS/REACH/VIDEO_VIEWS, WEBSITE_TRAFFIC allows CLICKS/PAGE_VIEWS/VIDEO_VIEWS, APP_PROMOTION allows APP_INSTALLS, ENGAGEMENT_ON_SPOTIFY allows CLICKS/STREAMS/VIDEO_VIEWS, LEAD_GEN allows LEADS/CLICKS, VIDEO_VIEWS allows VIDEO_VIEWS, CONVERSION allows IMPRESSIONS, SUBS_ENGAGEMENT allows IMPRESSIONS, RETENTION allows IMPRESSIONS", "When budget.type is LIFETIME: end_time is required", "When category is alcohol-related: targeted country must permit alcohol ads and targets.age_ranges[].min must be >= 18", "When category is gambling-related: targeted country must permit gambling ads", "When asset_format is VIDEO and placement_types contains IN_FEED: targets.platforms cannot include DESKTOP"], "constraints": ["end_time must be within 365 days of start_time", "budget.micro_amount: must meet the currency-specific minimum threshold; zero is not allowed", "Audience reach: projected unique users must be >= 100 (runtime check)", "Bid floor: bid_micro_amount must meet the audience scale suggested lower bound (runtime check)", "Targeted country: must be a targetable market; RESTRICTED markets are blocked unless the ad account has the restricted-country targeting exemption enabled"]}}, "ad": {"create": {"required_fields": ["assets.asset_id: primary asset required; must not be archived", "assets.logo_asset_id: required", "advertiser_name: required", "tagline: required", "call_to_action: required"], "cross_field_rules": ["When ad set asset_format is AUDIO: assets.companion_asset_id is required", "When ad set asset_format is IMAGE or CATALOG (display slot types): assets.companion_asset_id must not be set", "When assets.asset_id references a VIDEO asset: the video must have an audio track", "When assets.canvas_asset_id is set: primary asset cannot be VIDEO, and targets.platforms cannot be DESKTOP only"]}, "update": {"restrictions": ["Cannot edit an archived creative"]}, "both": {"cross_field_rules": ["When campaign objective is ENGAGEMENT_ON_SPOTIFY (or PODCAST_STREAMS): call_to_action.clickthrough_url must be an open.spotify.com URL or a Spotify URI", "When end_time is set: start_time is also required", "start_time must be >= ad set's start_time and < ad set's end_time", "end_time must be <= ad set's end_time and > ad set's start_time", "When start_time or end_time is new or changed: the value must be >= 1 hour in the future"], "constraints": ["Audio creative duration: max 31,000 ms", "Video creative duration: max 30,500 ms", "third_party_tracking: max 1 IAS pixel; MOAT tracking only for video; IAS for image only with display viewability enabled", "third_party_tracking: no duplicate entries"]}}}, "CONTENT": {"display_name": "Content (Fixed Priced Podcast Non-Guaranteed)", "description": "Fixed-price podcast ad product. AUDIO/VIDEO formats, PODCAST placement, LIFETIME budget.", "campaign": {"create": {"allowed_values": {"objective": ["UNSET_OPTIMIZATION_PREF"], "delivery_goal_group": ["UNSET", "AWARENESS", "WEBSITE_TRAFFIC", "APP_PROMOTION", "ENGAGEMENT_ON_SPOTIFY", "LEAD_GEN", "VIDEO_VIEWS"]}, "constraints": ["objective is force-set to UNSET_OPTIMIZATION_PREF by the server regardless of what is sent", "delivery_goal_group is force-set to UNSET by the server alongside objective, so it reads back as UNSET rather than null"]}, "update": {"allowed_values": {"status": ["ACTIVE", "PAUSED", "ARCHIVED"]}}, "both": {"constraints": ["end_time must be within 365 days of start_time", "start_time must be at least 15 minutes in the future"]}}, "ad_set": {"create": {"allowed_values": {"asset_format": ["AUDIO", "VIDEO"], "pacing": ["PACING_EVEN"]}, "required_fields": ["start_time: required; must be at least 15 minutes in the future", "end_time: required (CONTENT flights must have a defined end date)"]}, "update": {"restrictions": ["budget.type: cannot change (forced to LIFETIME)", "Budget decrease (LIFETIME, started flight): cannot go below pacing-aware floor; buffer is 1.1x for PACING_EVEN; 1-hour cooldown between decreases", "Cannot edit a completed ad set"]}, "both": {"allowed_values": {"bid_strategy": ["UNSET"], "budget.type": ["LIFETIME"], "targets.placements": ["PODCAST"]}, "frequency_caps": {"max_impressions": {"DAY": 5, "WEEK": 35, "MONTH": 50}}, "forbidden_fields": ["targets.platforms: any platform targeting is rejected (inclusions or exclusions)", "targets.language: language targeting is forbidden", "targets.playlist_ids: playlist targeting is forbidden"], "cross_field_rules": ["When budget.type is LIFETIME: end_time is required", "targets.geo_targets.country_code must be in the supported pricing list (53 countries)", "When country is RESTRICTED: ad account must be Aleph-enabled; otherwise only TARGETABLE markets are allowed", "When country does not list CONTENT in its supported ad products: targeting is rejected", "Submitted price must match the current rate card; price is re-validated when any of these targeting fields change: targets.age_ranges, targets.genders, targets.geo_targets", "Budget delivery likelihood: when enabled, forecast constraint must be BUDGET_LIMITED (runtime check)"], "constraints": ["end_time must be within 365 days of start_time", "budget.micro_amount: currency-dependent minimum (~$1,000 USD equivalent for new ad sets; legacy ad sets use config threshold minimums)", "Audience reach: projected unique users must be >= 100"]}}, "ad": {"create": {"required_fields": ["assets.asset_id: primary asset required; must not be archived", "assets.logo_asset_id: required", "advertiser_name: required", "tagline: required", "call_to_action: required"]}, "both": {"cross_field_rules": ["When end_time is set: start_time is also required", "start_time must be >= ad set's start_time and < ad set's end_time", "end_time must be <= ad set's end_time and > ad set's start_time", "When start_time or end_time is new or changed: the value must be >= 1 hour in the future"], "constraints": ["Audio creative duration: max 31,000 ms", "Video creative duration: max 30,500 ms"]}}}, "FPMNG": {"display_name": "FPMNG (Fixed Priced Music Non-Guaranteed)", "description": "Fixed-price music ad product. AUDIO/VIDEO/IMAGE formats, MUSIC placement, LIFETIME budget.", "campaign": {"create": {"allowed_values": {"objective": ["IMPRESSIONS", "UNSET_OPTIMIZATION_PREF"], "delivery_goal_group": ["UNSET", "AWARENESS", "WEBSITE_TRAFFIC", "APP_PROMOTION", "ENGAGEMENT_ON_SPOTIFY", "LEAD_GEN", "VIDEO_VIEWS"]}}, "update": {"allowed_values": {"status": ["ACTIVE", "PAUSED"]}}, "both": {"constraints": ["end_time must be within 365 days of start_time", "start_time: required; must be at least 15 minutes in the future"]}}, "ad_set": {"create": {"allowed_values": {"asset_format": ["AUDIO", "VIDEO", "IMAGE"]}, "required_fields": ["start_time: required; must be at least 15 minutes in the future"]}, "update": {"restrictions": ["budget.type: cannot change (forced to LIFETIME)", "Budget decrease (LIFETIME, started flight): cannot go below 1.0x lifetime spend; pacing-aware buffer applies; 1-hour cooldown between decreases", "Cannot edit a completed ad set"]}, "both": {"allowed_values": {"bid_strategy": ["UNSET"], "budget.type": ["LIFETIME"], "delivery_goal": ["IMPRESSIONS"], "pacing": ["PACING_EVEN"], "targets.placements": ["MUSIC"], "targets.platforms": ["ANDROID", "DESKTOP", "IOS"]}, "frequency_caps": {"max_impressions": {"DAY": 5, "WEEK": 35, "MONTH": 50}}, "required_fields": ["targets.platforms: at least one platform must be specified"], "cross_field_rules": ["When budget.type is LIFETIME: end_time is required", "Submitted price must match the rate card; rates differ by asset_format (AUDIO, VIDEO, IMAGE each have separate rates)", "Price is re-validated when any of these targeting fields change: targets.age_ranges, targets.genders, targets.geo_targets", "Budget delivery likelihood: when enabled, forecast constraint must be BUDGET_LIMITED (runtime check)", "targets.geo_targets.country_code must not be BF (Burkina Faso), MA (Morocco), MC (Monaco), or TN (Tunisia)"], "constraints": ["end_time must be within 365 days of start_time", "budget.micro_amount: currency-dependent minimum (~$1,000 USD for new ad sets after April 2026; legacy ad sets use $5,000 USD / $2,500 non-USD)", "Audience reach: projected unique users must be >= 100", "When no budget is provided on create: a default LIFETIME budget is applied (US-market: $5,000; non-US: $2,500)"]}}, "ad": {"create": {"required_fields": ["assets.asset_id: primary asset required; must not be archived", "assets.logo_asset_id: required", "advertiser_name: required", "tagline: required", "call_to_action: required"]}, "both": {"cross_field_rules": ["When end_time is set: start_time is also required", "start_time must be >= ad set's start_time and < ad set's end_time", "end_time must be <= ad set's end_time and > ad set's start_time", "When start_time or end_time is new or changed: the value must be >= 1 hour in the future"], "constraints": ["Audio creative duration: max 31,000 ms", "Video creative duration: max 30,500 ms"]}}}}, "description": "Ad product validation rules that layer on top of the OpenAPI spec. Each product defines the specific values, constraints, and rules that apply when creating or updating campaigns, ad sets, and ads. Rules are separated by operation: 'create' for creation-only rules, 'update' for update-only rules and restrictions, 'both' for rules that apply to all operations. Use the OpenAPI spec for request shape and field types; use this catalog for product-specific restrictions."}
